Parity arithmetic reproduced exactly from the web source (cross-platform value parity, NOT a
"corrected" version):
  distanceMi       = total_distance_km * 0.621371 (UNITS.KM_TO_MI)
  displayDistance  = convertDistanceFromSI(distanceMi, distancePref)  [ /1000 km · /1609.344 mi · /0.3048 ft ]
  longestDriveMi   = (longest_drive?.distance_km ?? 0) * 0.621371 ; convertDistanceFromSI(…, distancePref)
  fastestSpeedMph  = fastest_speed_kmh * 0.621371 ; displayFastestSpeed = convertSpeedFromSI(…, speedPref)
                     [ km/h: *3600/1000 · mph: *3600/1609.344 ]
  drivingTime      = fmtInt(round(total_driving_minutes / 60)) h
  busiestMonth     = max(drives) (FIRST on tie, like reduce's strict >) → short month symbol (en_US → "Jul"…)
  fmtNumber        = en_US grouped, fixed fraction digits, half-away-from-zero ; fmtInt = fmtNumber(_,0)
Web t() keys: title, totalDistance, totalDrives, energyUsed, co2Saved, busiestMonth, longestDrive,
              drivingTime, topSpeed, inYear, noData (11) — all in YearReviewWidget.strings.

